  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: सांगपाचें म्हणल्यार, हांव व्यक्तीगत सहाय्यक आनी सायडकीक.<br/>तुमी तयार जातकीर हांव तयार जाता.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: हाय, हांव Cortana.<br/>हांव हांगा तुमच्यो गजाली सोप्यो करूंक आनी सगळें वेवस्थीत जावंक आदारा खातीर आसा.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: Cortana तुमची सहाय्यक आसा, तुमकां कर्तुबी, साहसी वा वक्तशीर दवरता त्या कित्याय वांगडा आदार दिवंक एकदम तयार. <br/><br/>Cortana क वैयक्तीक अणभव आनी वास्तवीक सुचोवण्यो उपलब्ध करूंक दिवंक, Microsoft तुमचें थळ आनी थळाचो इतिहास, संपर्क, आवाज इनपूट, वाचा आनी हातबरप पद्दती, टंक इतिहास, सोद इतिहास, दिनदर्शिका तपशील, मजकूर आनी संदेश आनी ऍप्लिकेशनांतलो टंक इतिहास, आनी तुमच्या डिव्हायसावेली हेर म्हायती एकठांय करता आनी तिचो उपेग करता. Microsoft Edgeत , Cortana तुमचो ब्रावजींग इतिहास वापरता. Notebook त Cortana कितें याद दवरता तें तुमी सदांच टिंकर करूंक शकतात, Microsoft Edge त Cortana निश्क्रीय करूंक शकतात.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: तुमचो पासवर्ड नोंद करचो
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: सुरक्षे खातीर, उपकार करून आनीक एक खेपे तुमचो पासवर्ड नोंद करचो.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=KOK-IN: 2532485720
